  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Add basmati rice and a pinch of salt and cook, uncovered, over high heat until tender, 12 mins. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ad786bcdfd65d69c3816d/step-1597fe00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the rice is cooking, heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook sliced mushrooms until browned and softened, 6-8 mins.\n• Season, then transfer to a bowl.\n• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot and zucchini into half-moons. Finely chop garlic.\n• In a small bowl, combine Asian BBQ seasoning, the soy sauce, stock powder and sweet chilli sauce.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ad786bcdfd65d69c3816d/step-1fa82910.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook carrot and zucchini until slightly softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Add garlic, then crack the eggs into the pan and scramble until cooked through, 1-2 mins.\n• Stir in the cooked mushrooms, cooked rice, sweet chilli sauce mixture, stirring to combine, 1-2 mins. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ad786bcdfd65d69c3816d/step-099abd20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Chinese mixed veggie fried rice between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with crushed peanuts to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/697ad786bcdfd65d69c3816d/step-0e04b630.jpeg"
    }
  ]
